      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Additional detail: Worlds which have been deleted or set private by its author are not displaying world details such as names or photos, so this discrepancy in OP only affects DMCA'd worlds. (Deleted and privated worlds appear as paraphrased \"World Is Unavailable\" or \"World Is Set to Private\", the same as in the Steam client.)\n\nOddly enough, trying to move these deleted or privated worlds from the website deletes the worlds from the favorited worlds lists entirely without warning!",
